<title>NEW ZEALAND: New, ex-overseas vehicle registrations up in Sept.</title>
<headline>New, ex-overseas vehicle registrations up in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New and ex-overseas vehicle registrations rose 16 percent to 19,518 in September from 16,788 a year ago, The Land Transport and Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>New and ex-overseas car registrations rose to 14,790 from 12,428, while those for trucks fell to 2,445 from 2,545.</p>
<p>Bus and coach registrations rose to 117 from 59 and tractors were up at 176 from 115.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
